---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile, spokenLanguages, certifications } from '@/data/profile';
import { experience, timeline } from '@/data/experience';
import { hasPhoto } from '@/data/assets';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Sankalp Singh: two years of maths and physics, an aeromodelling certificate, and a habit of checking the second metric."
>
  <section class="shell top">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>I started with maths and physics, and I never really left.</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="shell intro">
    <div class="story">
      <p>
        My degree is in AI and Data Science, but the first two years were mathematics and physics.
        That turned out to be the useful part. The linear algebra is what makes a Kalman filter make
        sense, and the mechanics is what makes a drone in simulation behave like a body rather than a
        sprite.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before any of that I was building model aircraft. I have the aeromodelling certificate to show
        for it. Flying something you built yourself teaches you quickly that a thing can look correct
        on the bench and still be wrong in the air.
      </p>
      <p>
        That is the thread through everything here. I like simulations because they let me build a
        whole system and then attack it. My best work is usually the moment I found out my own result
        was not what I thought it was: the clearance check that passed nine times on a broken assembly,
        the early-warning signal that fired on zero of eight seeds, the deliberately unintelligent
        baseline that beat everything I had built.
      </p>
      <p>
        Next is an M.Sc. abroad for 2027, in Computational Science, Scientific Computing, CS or
        Robotics. I am looking at Germany, the Netherlands, Norway and the USA, and I am learning
        German for the first of those.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="side">
      {hasPhoto && <img src="/media/portrait.jpg" alt="Sankalp Singh" width="900" height="900" class="portrait" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />}
      <dl class="quick widget">
        <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>{profile.location}</dd></div>
        <div>
          <dt>Languages</dt>
          <dd>{spokenLanguages.map((l) => <span class="li">{l.name} <em>{l.level}</em></span>)}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Certifications</dt>
          <dd>{certifications.map((c) => <span class="li">{c.name}</span>)}</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="shell block">
    <h2 class="sec">Timeline</h2>
    <ol class="tl">
      {timeline.map((t) => (
        <li class="reveal">
          <span class="yr mono">{t.year}</span>
          <div class="tc widget">
            <h3>{t.title}</h3>
            <p>{t.body}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="shell block" id="experience">
    <h2 class="sec">Experience</h2>
    <ol class="exp">
      {experience.map((e) => (
        <li class="job widget reveal">
          <div class="jhead">
            <div>
              <h3>{e.role}</h3>
              <p class="org">{e.org}, {e.location}</p>
            </div>
            <span class="dates mono">{e.start} to {e.end}</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="hl">{e.highlights.map((h) => <li>{h}</li>)}</ul>
          <ul class="stack">{e.stack.map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}</ul>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .top { padding-top: 8rem; }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.6fr) minmax(0, 0.7fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  .story { font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 40rem; }
  .story p { margin: 0 0 1.4rem; }

  .side { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; position: sticky; top: 5rem; }

  .portrait {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .quick { margin: 0; padding: 1.5rem; display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .quick dt { font-size: 0.6875rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .quick dd { margin: 0.45rem 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .li em { font-style: normal; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 0.8125rem; }

  .block { margin-top: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem); }

  .sec { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); margin-bottom: 2rem; }

  .tl { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
  .tl li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 7rem minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; align-items: start; }
  .yr { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--accent); padding-top: 1.5rem; }
  .tc { padding: 1.5rem; }
  .tc h3 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .tc p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.65; }

  .exp { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .job { padding: 1.75rem; }
  .jhead { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
  .job h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .org { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .dates { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-faint); white-space: nowrap; }

  .hl { margin: 0 0 1.1rem; padding-left: 1.15rem; }
  .hl li { font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .stack { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .stack li { font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--ink-faint); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.25em 0.7em; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .side { position: static; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); align-items: start; }
    .portrait { max-width: 16rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .side { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tl li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .yr { padding-top: 0; }
  }
</style>
